  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">EEF 24 25 - Equalities Programming in North Africa</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">This project aims to tackle the barriers and enhance women&#x2019;s political participation in the Maghreb region. Women&#x2019;s involvement in politics is crucial for fostering democratic values and creating a fairer, more equitable society. This initiative brings together leading local voices from Morocco, Algeria, Tunisia, Libya and Egypt to develop strategies and tools for UK collaboration with Maghreb countries to drive positive change.</narrative>
  </description>
